    {
      "key": "lead",
      "type": "lead",
      "title": "ABOUT",
      "text": "**synthwerk-widgets** holds the embeddable widgets for [synthwerk](https://github.com/VelimirMueller/synthwerk). The chat widget ships as one custom element. The vision widget comes next."
    },
    {
      "key": "what",
      "type": "notes",
      "title": "THE SHORT VERSION",
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "lead": "One custom element",
          "text": "`<synthwerk-chat>` renders into an open shadow root. Host CSS and widget CSS do not mix."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Desktop and mobile",
          "text": "Launcher and panel on desktop, full-screen sheet on small screens."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Streamed answers",
          "text": "The answer streams in as safe Markdown. Raw HTML stays text."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Signed-in users only",
          "text": "Signed-out visitors see a sign-in prompt. The widget then sends no request."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "startnotes",
      "type": "notes",
      "title": "WHAT YOU GET",
      "items": [
        {
          "lead": "Embed",
          "text": "Load `synthwerk-chat.js` as a module, add `<synthwerk-chat app-id api-url>`, hand in the user token with `getUserToken`."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Details",
          "text": "Attributes, errors and limits: `docs/features/chat-widget.md`."
        }
      ],
      "columns": 2
    },
    {
      "key": "hownotes",
      "type": "notes",
      "title": "WHO MEETS WHOM",
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "lead": "Two services today",
          "text": "The chat trades the user token for a widget token at `synthwerk-identity`, then streams from `synthwerk-llm`."
        },
        {
          "lead": "The host page",
          "text": "The host page meets one element. The widget token stays in memory and is bound to the page origin."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "usage",
      "type": "notes",
      "title": "FACTS",
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "lead": "Ecosystem map",
          "text": "[synthwerk](https://github.com/VelimirMueller/synthwerk)."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Blueprint",
          "text": "Shared CI, lint configs and templates: [synthwerk-blueprint](https://github.com/VelimirMueller/synthwerk-blueprint)."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Renamed",
          "text": "This repo was renamed. The old URL still redirects here."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Old code",
          "text": "Tag `legacy-final` holds a Nuxt 3 chat page for the old GPT4All server."
        },
        {
          "lead": "Tier",
          "text": "Library: the bundle is built and packed in CI, not deployed yet."
        },
        {
          "lead": "License",
